# 018a §2-C: interactive HTML export (R-EXP-02, S-EXP-02), Copy as rich HTML and Save as PNG (R-EXP-06).
write-file hi.tmp.md "# Interactive\n\n## Math\n\nInline $e^{i\pi}+1=0$ and display:\n\n$$\n\int_0^1 x^2\,dx = \frac{1}{3}\n$$\n\n## Diagram\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\nA-->B\n```\n\n## Image\n\nLocal ![png](../corpus/002/typical-assets/one.png) and remote ![r](https://example.org/r.png).\n\n- one\n- two\n\n<script>alert(1)</script>\n"
command mode light
ui settings-set export.html_interactive=true
wait-idle
open hi.tmp.md
wait-idle
export-html hi.tmp.html
assert out_len > 1000
assert out_scripts == 1
assert out_csp_hash_ok == 1
assert out_ext_refs == 0
assert out_ext_src == 0
# Math (inline + display) and the Mermaid diagram are inline <svg>, not data: images.
assert out_svg >= 3
assert out_imgs == 1
# Static mode: no script at all.
ui settings-set export.html_interactive=false
wait-idle
export-html hi-static.tmp.html
assert out_scripts == 0
assert out_csp == 1
assert out_ext_src == 0
ui settings-set export.html_interactive=true
wait-idle
# Copy as rich HTML: CF_HTML without <script and with consistent offsets.
command copy-rich
wait-idle
assert clip_html == 1
assert clip_html_scripts == 0
assert clip_html_offsets_ok == 1
# Save as PNG… on the diagram and on the mind map write valid PNG files.
ui save-to hi-diagram.tmp.png
ui diagram-save-png
wait-idle
assert out_png_w > 0
key ctrl+shift+m
wait-idle
assert mind == right
ui save-to hi-mind.tmp.png
key ctrl+s
wait-idle
assert out_png_w > 0
key ctrl+shift+m
wait-idle
